{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00001",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 4.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.17,
      "end_seconds": 8.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.84,
      "end_seconds": 13.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Doctor, it's pain in both knees. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.44,
      "end_seconds": 16.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.64,
      "end_seconds": 25.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "Yeah, it's been six months, I'm fairly sure. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.79,
      "end_seconds": 29.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Do you notice anything setting it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.24,
      "end_seconds": 33.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Yes, squatting and stairs. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.93,
      "end_seconds": 37.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Okay, how bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.7,
      "end_seconds": 40.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.02,
      "end_seconds": 44.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "So, have you found anything that eases it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.31,
      "end_seconds": 49.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Only rest and a hot pack, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.4,
      "end_seconds": 53.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.91,
      "end_seconds": 65.77,
      "duration_seconds": 11.86,
      "text": "Stiffness in the morning goes along with it, most of the time. Uh, about stiffness in the morning, maybe a six out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.2,
      "end_seconds": 69.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.77,
      "end_seconds": 75.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.99,
      "end_seconds": 77.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "And fall, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.06,
      "end_seconds": 82.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Oh, no, I haven't had any fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.02,
      "end_seconds": 87.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Any locking of the knee or pain in other joints at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.85,
      "end_seconds": 95.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Yeah, I haven't had locking of the knee or pain in other joints, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.48,
      "end_seconds": 98.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.87,
      "end_seconds": 108.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "It's diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed. So, it's paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.46,
      "end_seconds": 114.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.18,
      "end_seconds": 117.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.97,
      "end_seconds": 122.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.09,
      "end_seconds": 125.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.46,
      "end_seconds": 130.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.21,
      "end_seconds": 141.32,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "Hmm, I've had arthritis in my knees for nearly five years now. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.53,
      "end_seconds": 144.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Right. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.6,
      "end_seconds": 148.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.38,
      "end_seconds": 152.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Alright, are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.94,
      "end_seconds": 157.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.48,
      "end_seconds": 161.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.4,
      "end_seconds": 163.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.49,
      "end_seconds": 166.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.54,
      "end_seconds": 187.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Bending is limited to about a right angle, and it hurts at the end."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.07,
      "end_seconds": 191.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.32,
      "end_seconds": 214.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "There's mild swelling on the right knee, and a grating feel when I bend it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.04,
      "end_seconds": 234.69,
      "duration_seconds": 14.65,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.62,
      "end_seconds": 237.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.8,
      "end_seconds": 259.02,
      "duration_seconds": 20.22,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like osteoarthritis of the knees. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in both knees for six months, mild, and no locking of the knee or fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.04,
      "end_seconds": 261.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.65,
      "end_seconds": 278.09,
      "duration_seconds": 16.44,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.6,
      "end_seconds": 280.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.39,
      "end_seconds": 290.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "We should do blood tests for joint pain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.47,
      "end_seconds": 292.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.99,
      "end_seconds": 299.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the knees, and I'd like you to do the strengthening exercises."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.4,
      "end_seconds": 312.4,
      "duration_seconds": 12.0,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.75,
      "end_seconds": 313.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.31,
      "end_seconds": 316.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Let's review you in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.75,
      "end_seconds": 320.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.74,
      "end_seconds": 330.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.82,
      "end_seconds": 335.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.19,
      "end_seconds": 340.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.15,
      "end_seconds": 344.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.05,
      "end_seconds": 347.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}